GoodHours / Hourly

A school service-hours platform for students, schools, and community partners.

Current status
- Active rework branch
- Customer-facing flow work is focused on signup/login, browse, signup/waitlist, and attendance verification
- Latest QA notes live in tests/qa-results.md

Local development
- Client: cd client && npm ci && npm run dev
- Server: cd server && npm ci && npm run dev

Production build
- Client: cd client && npm run build
- Server: cd server && npm run build

Notes
- Students browse school-approved opportunities and sign up or waitlist directly from the slot detail page.
- Students can check in, check out, and submit verification from the dashboard.
- School admins handle school registration and verification workflows.
